ing on parameters critical to earlier tasks, reducing catastrophic forgetting via a quadratic regulariser.\u003C/p>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"icarl--incremental-classifier-and-representation-learning\">iCaRL – Incremental Classifier and Representation Learning\u003C/h3>\n\u003C!-- \u003Csmall>[arXiv:1611.07725](https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.07725)\u003C/small> -->\n\u003Cp>Learns new classes incrementally with exemplar rehearsal + nearest-mean classifier; no catastrophic forgetting.\u003C/p>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"learning-without-forgetting\">Learning without Forgetting\u003C/h3>\n\u003C!-- \u003Csmall>[arXiv:1606.09282](https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.09282)\u003C/small> -->\n\u003Cp>Uses knowledge distillation to preserve performance on old tasks while training on new tasks — no access to old data.\u003C/p>",{"headings":61,"localImagePaths":71,"remoteImagePaths":72,"frontmatter":73,"imagePaths":78},[62,65,68],{"depth":31,"slug":63,"text":64},"elastic-weight-consolidation","Elastic Weight Consolidation",{"depth":31,"slug":66,"text":67},"icarl--incremental-classifier-and-representation-learning","iCaRL – Incremental Classifier and Representation Learning",{"depth":31,"slug":69,"text":70},"learning-without-forgetting","Learning without Forgetting",[],[],{"title":49,"description":50,"date":74,"info":75},["Date","2025-08-15T00:00:00.000Z"],[76],{"text":19,"icon":77},{"type":21,"name":22},[],"posts",["Map",11,81],{"id":11,"data":82,"body":92,"filePath":93,"digest":94,"rendered":95},{"title":83,"createdAt":84,"description":85,"tags":86,"draft":91},"Misc blog",["Date","2025-08-25T00:00:00.000Z"],"Hi from blog.mdx",[87,89],{"id":40,"collection":88},"tags",{"id":90,"collection":88},"blog",false,"### Hi this is from hi.mdxA\n\n---\n\n\u003Cp> its just some dumb testing\u003C/p>","src/content/posts/hi.md","5dba4100a8832b76",{"html":96,"metadata":97},"\u003Ch3 id=\"hi-this-is-from-himdxa\">Hi this is from hi.mdxA\u003C/h3>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cp> its just some dumb testing\u003C/p>",